  "intro": "The AI Age & Gender Detector estimates a person's age range and gender presentation from a single photo, using the face-api.js neural network running entirely in your browser via TensorFlow.js. Face detection and inference both happen on your own device, so the photo you analyze is never uploaded to a server.",
