  "intro": "The Barcode Generator renders 20 symbologies entirely in your browser. Nineteen linear formats — Code 128 (plus its A, B and C subsets), EAN-13, EAN-8, EAN-5, EAN-2, UPC-A, Code 39, ITF, ITF-14, MSI with Mod 10/11/1010/1110 check digits, Pharmacode and Codabar — are drawn by the JsBarcode library, while QR codes are drawn by qrcode.react at error-correction level M. Every edit re-renders after a 120 ms debounce into both a visible canvas and a hidden SVG twin, and that SVG is the vector source for the SVG and EPS downloads; PDFs are written with jsPDF on a page sized to the barcode. Bulk CSV jobs are parsed with PapaParse and zipped with JSZip locally, so nothing you type or upload is sent to a server.",
